  destinations:
  - destinationName: Lake Tekapo
    description: Turquoise waters sparkle beneath mountain peaks Wildflowers bloom
      along the scenic shoreline lear skies create stunning reflections Nature remains
      pristine and untouched Peaceful beauty surrounds the lake.
    background: {fileID: -5926442338173747971, guid: b6453401a90a544ac91328f74874ffc0, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Hobbiton Countryside
    description: Rolling green hills stretch across the landscape Charming cottages
      blend into grassy slopes Stone pathways wind through peaceful meadows Colorful
      gardens brighten every corner A storybook setting comes to life.
    background: {fileID: -5603132071634839591, guid: 177683bfe92ba493a923cd334a28f97d, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Milford Sound
    description: Towering cliffs rise from deep blue waters. Waterfalls cascade from
      dramatic heights. Mist drifts through breathtaking fjords. Untouched wilderness
      defines the scenery. Every view feels extraordinary.
    background: {fileID: 5165182218023545704, guid: 8af5569934130457e8f7b945ae66e241, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Queenstown Lakeside
    description: 'Mountain peaks surround crystal-clear waters

      Scenic walkways
      hug the tranquil shoreline

      Adventure and beauty coexist naturally

      Fresh
      alpine air fills the landscape

      A vibrant destination awaits visitors'
    background: {fileID: 8912668397776208328, guid: c1595e3bb85e4466197d0e0dfacf97a0, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Rotorua Gardens
    description: 'Colorful gardens flourish beside geothermal wonders. Steam rises
      from the surrounding landscape. Walking paths reveal beautiful floral displays.
      Nature and science meet in harmony

      Unique beauty defines the region.'
    background: {fileID: -4248272374454032252, guid: bc534a55177594981aa4963b68515cef, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Abel Tasman Coast
    description: 'Golden beaches meet turquoise coastal waters. Forest trails overlook
      scenic shorelines

      Gentle waves create a peaceful atmosphere

      Sunshine
      brightens the coastal landscape

      Adventure and relaxation await together'
    background: {fileID: 4903670820111749089, guid: 994fc87d509c046d0ba898d871f193d1, type: 3}
